{"version":1,"content":"<p>26歲女警伊利沙伯醫院誕嬰後離世，家屬事隔9年，在上月初獲醫委會秘書處通知，因「證據不足」結束投訴，家屬早前向醫衛局長發信申訴，質疑偵委會未參考死因研訊證供，就作結案決定。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T08:39:51.232508+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T08:09:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T08:37:45.321898+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:37:45.321898+00:00","content_hash":"88b36aa464ee83245c88172266b16a32dee7c6a00594b62a6e9a87b4d0008258","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}